id: pm-vcs-bhsk
title: Exclude SDK tracker runtime caches from native VCS merges
description: PR #91 hands-on two-agent real pm update merge conflicted only on runtime context usage. Resolve tracker roots through the SDK and exclude its runtime fence in status and staging; prove clean merge and verification on server and clones.
type: Issue
status: in_progress
priority: 1
tags: []
created_at: "2026-10-05T07:29:52.383Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-05T08:51:19.207Z"
author: codex-sol
parent: pm-vcs-5h6j
dependencies[1]{id,kind,created_at,author,source_kind,author_source}:
